Marguerite, results from the in-situ relative humidity probes are attached.=
 Fourteen probes were placed per ASTM F2170, drilled to 40% depth, sealed a=
nd read at 72 hours.<br />
<br />
Summary: readings ranged from 92% to 96% RH. Twelve of the fourteen probes =
read above 93%. The lowest reading on the entire eight floors was 92% at th=
e northeast core on Level 12.<br />
<br />
For context, the specification threshold is 85% RH. Nothing on this slab is=
 close. Lightweight fill over metal deck at this age is behaving exactly as=
 expected.
